<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25982" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασφάξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άγος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασφάζω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>any opening made by
				violence, rent,</i> esp. <i>gorge,</i> through which a river
			runs, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.158
			</span></i> (pl.),<i><span class="en">
				3.117
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>cleft</i> in the earth, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				317
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic., of
				<i>divisions</i> of blood-vessels, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; <i>fissure</i> in the liver, <i><span class="en">
				Herophil.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.570
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>sluice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1188.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>gill-cavity,</i> in fishes, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.744
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θῆλυ μόριον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				897.60
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
